usage: replay.py [-h] --database DATABASE [--run RUN] [--execute]
                 [--accept-review]

Reproduce the frozen historical diagnostic batch in a restored, isolated
database.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --database DATABASE  restored demo_8877_* database
  --run RUN            reuse this run path for review and execution
  --execute
  --accept-review
